{"4022730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Checkpoint Inc", "steam_appid": 4022730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.poster.avif?t=1761870870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.webm?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.mp4?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Border Business Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small checkpoint: a single barrier and empty lots.<br>Open new businesses — from a modest mini-market and pizzeria to a gas station, hotel, or cinema.<br>Each business generates income that helps you expand and upgrade your post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the barrier to speed up work, reduce waiting lines, and increase traffic flow — so the money keeps rolling in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.poster.avif?t=1761870870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.webm?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.mp4?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check Vehicles — Make the Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you’ll have to step onto the road and press the <strong>“Check”</strong> button.<br>Passengers will share their stories — sometimes touching, sometimes suspicious.<br>Your decision to let them through or hold them back affects both your checkpoint’s reputation and your income.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.poster.avif?t=1761870870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.webm?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/b59a05658e1aeb8b961e2d5aee1a1c55.mp4?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Border Business Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a small checkpoint: a single barrier and empty lots.<br>Open new businesses — from a modest mini-market and pizzeria to a gas station, hotel, or cinema.<br>Each business generates income that helps you expand and upgrade your post.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the barrier to speed up work, reduce waiting lines, and increase traffic flow — so the money keeps rolling in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.poster.avif?t=1761870870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.webm?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/extras/88840e6aadf1c5e6cc4c3b63f0ba1247.mp4?t=1761870870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check Vehicles — Make the Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you’ll have to step onto the road and press the <strong>“Check”</strong> button.<br>Passengers will share their stories — sometimes touching, sometimes suspicious.<br>Your decision to let them through or hold them back affects both your checkpoint’s reputation and your income.</p>", "short_description": "Develop your border checkpoint: upgrade the barrier and businesses, earn money, and optimize operations. Turn a small checkpoint into a profitable station — in this short and engaging game", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/9408e8e2214c98b64b4b54c0c345da2325018d50/header.jpg?t=1761870870", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/c4b6f13f970d4866f13317416f0c4eca8903de84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761870870", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022730/c4b6f13f970d4866f13317416f0c4eca8903de84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761870870", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD FX<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 430 / Radeon HD 5570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 650 / Radeon HD 7750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li>